:29.69,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,kDialogue: 1,0:01:29.71,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,nDialogue: 1,0:01:29.69,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,oDialogue: 1,0:01:29.76,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,cDialogue: 1,0:01:29.79,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,kDialogue: 1,0:01:29.77,0:01:31.37,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.84,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,dDialogue: 1,0:01:29.86,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 1,0:01:29.86,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,yDialogue: 0,0:01:29.86,0:01:34.65,English - OP18,,0,0,0,,and keep on going through the hard knock days.Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.86,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 2,0:01:30.06,0:01:30.40,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,suDialogue: 2,0:01:30.06,0:01:30.56,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,suDialogue: 2,0:01:30.31,0:01:30.65,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,muDialogue: 2,0:01:30.56,0:01:30.94,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,beDialogue: 2,0:01:30.65,0:01:31.19,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,kiDialogue: 2,0:01:30.94,0:01:31.67,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,hardDialogue: 2,0:01:31.37,0:01:31.98,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,knockDialogue: 2,0:01:31.67,0:01:34.65,Romaji - OP18 Styleı,,0,0,0,fx,daysDialogue: 0,0:01:42.62,0:01:47.62,Title,,0,0,240,,Heaven and EarthDialogue: 0,0:01:45.02,0:01:47.62,Main,,0,0,0,,How dare that punk do that?!Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.62,0:01:51.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Before Lucy comes to, this country will be shred to pieces!Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.16,0:01:54.38,Main,,0,0,0,,We gotta do something about it ourselves!Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.38,0:01:58.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Take down Doflamingo, and the bird cage goes away!Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.85,0:02:06.46,Main,,0,0,0,,You really are dense.Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.98,0:02:10.48,Main,,0,0,0,,My message to you should be clear: "Give me Straw Hat."Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.99,0:02:26.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Gatz-san, Lucy still needs more time to recover! But I believe many people will die before that happens!Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.00,0:02:31.04,Main,,0,0,0,,I know! But I can't send an incapacitated fighter into the ring!Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.04,0:02:33.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Whatever happens, I won't give him up before he's recovered!Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.40,0:02:41.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Who's there?Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.02,0:02:50.02,Main,,0,0,0,,T... T-T-Trafalgar Law!Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.02,0:02:51.52,Main,,0,0,0,,The W-W-Warlo...Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.52,0:02:55.45,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys... don't you think you're running too much?Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.45,0:02:57.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's because... Um...Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.74,0:03:00.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Will he regain his Haki?Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.24,0:03:03.53,Main,,0,0,0,,O-Oh, the thing is...Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.53,0:03:05.53,Main,,0,0,0,,He told me that he needed ten minutes,Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.53,0:03:08.29,Main,,0,0,0,,and now we've got three minutes and twenty seconds to go!Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.43,0:03:11.33,Main,,0,0,0,,No time to lose, then.Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.33,0:03:13.83,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of him from here.Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.83,0:03:14.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.72,0:03:23.93,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Less than three minutes remain until the bird cage closes completely.Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.09,0:03:26.43,Captions,,0,0,645,,SevioDialogue: 0,0:03:27.45,0:03:28.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Barrier!Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.02,0:03:32.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, let's do this, guys!Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.61,0:03:35.36,Main,,0,0,0,,My barrier will never break!Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.36,0:03:37.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Push!Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.37,0:03:46.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Follow Zoro-senpai!Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.08,0:03:56.63,Main,,0,0,0,,King!Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.20,0:04:01.88,Main,,0,0,0,,All together now, and push!Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.10,0:04:05.61,Main,,0,0,0,,How strange.Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.61,0:04:09.10,Main,,0,0,0,,How can they exert that much power with those injured bodies?Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.09,0:04:17.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Just a few minutes ago, they were burned out and couldn't even stand up.Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.95,0:04:21.65,Main,,0,0,0,,What was all that fluff?Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.25,0:04:24.95,Main,,0,0,0,,They were Dandehealions.Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.95,0:04:25.95,Main,,0,0,0,,"Dandehealions"?Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.95,0:04:26.74,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right!Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.28,0:04:33.04,Main,,0,0,0,,They're dandelions made from Princess Mansherry's tears.Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.49,0:04:47.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait for me, wait for me!Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.90,0:04:50.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, or you'll get torn to shreds!Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.10,0:04:51.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Run faster!Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.91,0:04:55.89,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't, dammit! I can't believe I twisted my ankle at a time like this!Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.88,0:05:02.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Hang in there!Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.69,0:05:06.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?! I can run!Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.00,0:05:08.24,Main,,0,0,0,,He's way too fast! What's going on?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.24,0:05:14.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Dandehealion petals can miraculously heal people over a wide area.Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.13,0:05:22.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Princess Mansherry is worried about what's happening to Dressrosa,Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.34,0:05:24.59,Main,,0,0,0,,and so she's shedding tears.Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.59,0:05:27.63,Main,,0,0,0,,I truly believe it will save many lives!Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.56,0:05:32.93,Main,,0,0,0,,So that's why those previously immobile fighters are...Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.93,0:05:35.39,Main,,0,0,0,,However, the drawback of this ability is...Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.39,0:05:39.94,Main,,0,0,0,,that it's only a temporary recovery, lasting for just a few minutes!Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.48,0:05:44.49,Main,,0,0,0,,It's unfortunate, but they'll revert to their former state when time's up!Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.49,0:05:48.82,Main,,0,0,0,,So this is a last-ditch life support measure for our survival!Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.37,0:05:52.53,Main,,0,0,0,,The pain just suddenly left!Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.53,0:05:55.45,Main,,0,0,0,,I can run! I can escape!Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.45,0:05:57.55,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a miracle, doctor!Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.55,0:06:00.38,Main,,0,0,0,,The gods themselves must have descended to save our country!Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.71,0:06:02.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Kabu-san...Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.71,0:06:05.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, Princess Mansherry?Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.22,0:06:07.40,Main,,0,0,0,,This is how I fight!Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.03,0:06:11.93,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to use weapons,Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.20,0:06:15.93,Main,,0,0,0,,and I can't bring down bad people, but...Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.93,0:06:20.44,Main,,0,0,0,,the tears won't stop!Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.44,0:06:24.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's very you! An honorable way to fight!Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.03,0:06:31.16,Main,,0,0,0,,How in the... The injured are recovering, one after another!Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.20,0:06:32.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's just get outta here!Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.50,0:06:34.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a minute!Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.20,0:06:37.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Heed my voice! Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.76,0:06:40.75,Main,,0,0,0,,What is it, Hundredth-Degree Hack?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.75,0:06:42.75,Main,,0,0,0,,No, the guy behind him!Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.33,0:06:49.38,Main,,0,0,0,,It's the five-star, God Usopp!Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.38,0:06:51.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Just what kind of crime did he commit?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.14,0:06:52.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright, listen up, men!Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.85,0:06:55.85,Main,,0,0,0,,The strong among you need to go to the east and west sides of town!Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.85,0:06:59.35,Main,,0,0,0,,My friends are pushing back the bird cage in those places!Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.35,0:07:01.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Give 'em a hand!Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.02,0:07:04.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Help them push back the bird cage?Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.02,0:07:05.90,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't think there's even a way to stop that thing!Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.90,0:07:08.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, there's no way!Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.07,0:07:11.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Quit making excuses! Believe in my friends!Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.78,0:07:14.24,Main,,0,0,0,,It's the wrath of God!Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.24,0:07:15.83,Main,,0,0,0,,We're on it!Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.83,0:07:16.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Run!Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.57,0:07:17.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.87,0:07:20.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Everybody, don't abandon hope!Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.87,0:07:23.50,Main,,0,0,0,,There are people who haven't yet given up!Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.70,0:07:25.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Come on, hurry up!Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.83,0:07:27.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Rebecca!Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.61,0:07:30.05,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,They're all trying so hard to stop the bird cage...Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.94,0:07:47.82,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,But if this bird cage really is unstoppable, all of their efforts will be wasted!Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.26,0:08:10.21,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I know I'm no match for him, but...Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.21,0:08:13.54,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,But everybody's fighting at their hardest!Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.54,0:08:15.55,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I've got to do something, too!Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.18,0:08:20.54,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Father... If push comes to shove, I'll...Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.26,0:08:24.88,Main,,0,0,0,,kill Doflamingo!Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.94,0:08:30.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Viola-san!Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.74,0:08:34.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Rebecca! Why are you here?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.07,0:08:36.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Viola-san, I...Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.74,0:08:38.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't do anything foolish!Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.21,0:08:44.67,Main,,0,0,0,,If I allow you to die, I won't be able to face Kyros, nor my late sister!Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.67,0:08:48.75,Main,,0,0,0,,So, what did you come to see me for, Viola?Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.06,0:08:56.01,Main,,0,0,0,,The Donquixote Family is about to be obliterated.Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.31,0:09:01.60,Main,,0,0,0,,If I do nothing to take responsibility as a former commander, it would be too selfish of me.Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.60,0:09:02.64,Main,,0,0,0,,You can't!Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.03,0:09:17.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Either I die, or you die!Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.79,0:09:20.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Doffy!Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.95,0:09:26.96,Main,,0,0,0,,You're ever the passionate one, Violet.Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.03,0:09:32.05,Captions,,0,1000,330,,Town CenterDialogue: 0,0:09:27.56,0:09:30.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, we've come all this way! Just let us through!Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.54,0:09:33.05,Main,,0,0,0,,The bird cage is right there!Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.05,0:09:36.63,Main,,0,0,0,,They say there's danger ahead, and we can barely advance here as well!Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.63,0:09:41.35,Main,,0,0,0,,People all over the country arrived here at the same time, so we can't even move!Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.35,0:09:44.35,Captions,,0,0,500,,Smile FactoryDialogue: 0,0:09:47.56,0:09:52.07,Main,,0,0,0,,You gotta push more! Push harder!Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.10,0:09:57.69,Main,,0,0,0,,The bird cage will definitely stop! Just keep pushing!Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.69,0:09:59.62,Main,,0,0,0,,We got it!Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.16,0:10:05.16,Captions,,0,0,425,,Vicinity of the Smile Factory         At the Bird CageDialogue: 0,0:10:08.73,0:10:10.33,Main,,0,0,0,,How are we faring?Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.33,0:10:14.84,Main,,0,0,0,,It's slowing down... I think!Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.84,0:10:18.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it, it does appear to be slowing down!Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.34,0:10:30.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.17,0:10:35.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh my... I can't tell who's there, as I'm blind.Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.79,0:10:48.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Crap!Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.46,0:11:01.48,Main,,0,0,0,,It's hard to leave behind such a band of fools, is it not?Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.48,0:11:06.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Please allow me to assist in even the slightest capacity, despite my limited ability!Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.04,0:11:09.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Company, halt!Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.39,0:11:15.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Support those "unknown" people pushing the cage!Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.19,0:11:16.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Aye aye, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.41,0:11:17.28,Main,,0,0,0,,The Navy?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.49,0:11:23.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, quite the aid!Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.49,0:11:25.28,Main,,0,0,0,,This is encouraging!Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.18,0:11:29.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Those of you unable to use Haki, head for the factory!Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.29,0:11:30.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Aye aye, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.58,0:11:35.34,Main,,0,0,0,,The Navy?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.34,0:11:37.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Push the bird cage back!Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.01,0:11:44.47,Main,,0,0,0,,R-Run for it!Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.34,0:11:48.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, what're you doing?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.39,0:11:51.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Nothing'll change if we just keep running!Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.18,0:11:52.81,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna push, too!Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.81,0:11:54.45,Main,,0,0,0,,H-Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.45,0:11:56.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Push!Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.48,0:11:59.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, dammit, I'll push, too!Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.90,0:12:01.90,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm no weakling!Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.90,0:12:03.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's the spirit!Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.91,0:12:05.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Me neither!Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.32,0:12:06.83,Main,,0,0,0,,We're gonna push, too!Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.83,0:12:09.33,Main,,0,0,0,,We wanna defend our own country!Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.33,0:12:11.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Push it, all together now!Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.16,0:12:15.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright, you guys! Give it everything you've got!Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.29,0:12:17.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.89,0:12:20.88,Captions,,0,0,645,,SevioDialogue: 0,0:12:20.92,0:12:21.92,Main,,0,0,0,,There they are!Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.08,0:12:27.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Warriors, let us push too!Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.06,0:12:29.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Get pushing already!Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.77,0:12:30.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.52,0:12:34.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Us, too!Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.02,0:12:35.98,Main,,0,0,0,,We can't just let it cut us without doing anything!Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.48,0:12:38.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you all! I'm counting on you!Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.48,0:12:41.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's work together!Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.28,0:12:43.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Here we go, guys!Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.00,0:12:44.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.07,0:12:46.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go!Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.47,0:12:48.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.00,0:12:50.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Push!Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.56,0:13:32.70,Main,,0,0,0,,It's moving again!Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.70,0:13:35.54,Main,,0,0,0,,But it did stop for a moment.Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.54,0:13:41.09,Main,,0,0,0,,So it's stoppable! Zoro-senpai is as awesome as ever!Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.09,0:13:45.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Keep pushing! Let's stall the shutting of the bird cage!Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.09,0:13:47.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Stay focused!Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.00,0:13:49.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Hold on! Put more into it!Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.18,0:13:54.68,Main,,0,0,0,,What... Your Majesty? Army Commander Tank?Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.68,0:13:56.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Well done!Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.70,0:14:02.94,Main,,0,0,0,,If it weren't for you all, we would've lost thousands already!Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.03,0:14:06.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Screw this bird cage!Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.28,0:14:11.07,Main,,0,0,0,,People are meant to be free! Keep pushing!Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.07,0:14:12.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.74,0:14:14.29,Main,,0,0,0,,More!Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.29,0:14:16.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.00,0:14:20.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Push the bird cage back!Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.71,0:14:27.67,Main,,0,0,0,,That's enough, Viola-san!Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.74,0:14:37.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Viola-san!Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.20,0:14:42.69,Main,,0,0,0,,A decade...Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.03,0:14:51.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Did you really think I would hesitate just because we spent all that time together as a Family, Violet?Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.70,0:14:54.74,Main,,0,0,0,,That I would hesitate to kill you?Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.12,0:15:05.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't criticize my associates for their mistakes.Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.42,0:15:10.43,Main,,0,0,0,,However, I don't condone betrayal.Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.35,0:15:25.61,Main,,0,0,0,,And now, next up is...Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.70,0:15:36.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Look at her, Violet!Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.72,0:15:42.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Rebecca!Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.59,0:15:48.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Viola-san... I can't control my body...Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.88,0:15:53.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Poor girl. She's so scared.Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.27,0:15:54.10,Main,,0,0,0,,You can't!Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.75,0:16:15.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, right this way!Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.41,0:16:19.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Don't involve Rebecca!Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.51,0:16:22.54,Main,,0,0,0,,What am I... doing?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.04,0:16:25.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Viola-san!Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.21,0:16:27.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Rebecca!Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.21,0:16:31.21,Main,,0,0,0,,No! I don't wanna do this!Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.17,0:16:34.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, kill her.Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.87,0:16:42.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Viola-san!Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.77,0:16:45.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Why am I doing this?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.36,0:16:50.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Rebecca!Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.16,0:16:56.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna do this!Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.28,0:17:01.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Viola-san!Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.17,0:17:08.67,Main,,0,0,0,,It's starting to slice up the old Royal Grounds!Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.67,0:17:11.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn! It stopped once!Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.67,0:17:14.84,Main,,0,0,0,,If it keeps closing in, people will start dying one after another!Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.84,0:17:16.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't give up! Keep pushing!Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.84,0:17:19.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Stall it even for a second!Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.52,0:17:26.60,Main,,0,0,0,,How long till Lucy's back up?Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.60,0:17:28.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh, let me see...Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.20,0:17:33.35,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Time until the slowed bird cage closes completely:Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.23,0:17:38.51,Narrator,,0,0,0,,sixty seconds.Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.49,0:17:41.99,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Time remaining until Lucy's comeback:Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.01,0:17:44.30,Narrator,,0,0,0,,sixty seconds.Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.80,0:17:53.67,Main,,0,0,0,,It stopped once!Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.17,0:17:56.17,Main,,0,0,0,,We can keep on holding it back!Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.05,0:18:03.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop the cage!Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.90,0:18:14.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Stand strong and hang in there!Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.48,0:18:16.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up! You're distracting us!Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.80,0:18:22.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's make this the greatest thing we've ever done!Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.45,0:18:39.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Please... Please be safe...Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.55,0:18:42.05,Main,,0,0,0,,As many lives as possible...Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.02,0:18:50.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright, everyone!Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.80,0:18:54.22,Main,,0,0,0,,It won't be much longer!Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.92,0:18:57.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-Who's talking?Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.12,0:19:05.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Who is that? Now isn't the time!Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.62,0:19:07.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Where is he shouting from?Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.72,0:19:10.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Our star shall return!Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.54,0:19:12.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey!Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.13,0:19:13.63,Main,,0,0,0,,There he is!Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.13,0:19:21.93,Main,,0,0,0,,You're the announcer from the Colosseum, Gatz!Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.68,0:19:24.18,Main,,0,0,0,,When did you get up there?Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.18,0:19:25.35,Main,,0,0,0,,And what are you up to?Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.39,0:19:27.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone, have you forgotten?Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.79,0:19:29.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Now isn't the time to fool around!Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.40,0:19:35.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Our country is on the verge of destruction!Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.40,0:19:37.32,Main,,0,0,0,,You aren't the king!Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.86,0:19:42.03,Main,,0,0,0,,No, of course you haven't forgotten!Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.32,0:19:49.29,Main,,0,0,0,,That funny, bold star who burst onto the scene...Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.29,0:19:55.29,Main,,0,0,0,,in the tournament at the Corrida Colosseum today!Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.21,0:19:57.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Star?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.71,0:20:00.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me he's talking about...Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.22,0:20:02.82,Main,,0,0,0,,...me! Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.72,0:20:12.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, I told you I'd stay here with you, but would you mind if I departed?Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.73,0:20:13.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Trafal...Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.85,0:20:16.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Gah! Law! He's gone!Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.86,0:20:18.86,Main,,0,0,0,,What... where did he go?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.86,0:20:24.07,Main,,0,0,0,,I have not forgotten.Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.07,0:20:29.91,Main,,0,0,0,,He tamed the killer bull feared by all,Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.91,0:20:33.00,Main,,0,0,0,,and toppled the towering Giant!Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.64,0:20:38.21,Main,,0,0,0,,He even knocked out the living legend, Don Chinjao!Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.80,0:20:46.47,Main,,0,0,0,,The little gladiator who made the Colosseum... nay, the whole of Dressrosa burst with excitement!Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.81,0:20:50.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Never before have I seen anyone fight so freely,Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.72,0:20:57.06,Main,,0,0,0,,and make a competition as thrilling as he did!Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.06,0:21:03.02,Main,,0,0,0,,I was there watching it! He's talking about that guy, isn't he?Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.02,0:21:04.57,Main,,0,0,0,,I saw him at the Colosseum!Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.57,0:21:07.03,Main,,0,0,0,,I watched it on a screen in town!Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.03,0:21:08.53,Main,,0,0,0,,And his name is...Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.03,0:21:13.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Lucy!Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.50,0:21:17.50,Main,,0,0,0,,So what? He's just some gladiator!Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.25,0:21:20.75,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Lucy...Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.86,0:21:25.13,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Help me, Lucy...Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.13,0:21:27.64,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right! It's Lucy!Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.64,0:21:31.76,Main,,0,0,0,,But that was just an alias!Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.10,0:21:35.27,Main,,0,0,0,,His real name is...Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.65,0:21:43.53,Main,,0,0,0,,The pirate, Straw Hat...Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.47,0:21:46.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.07,0:21:51.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Wha... that's who Lucy was under his mask?Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.03,0:21:56.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Since we've been fooled by and been under the control of a pirate,Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.08,0:21:59.28,Main,,0,0,0,,it's probably difficult for us to trust another pirate!Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.28,0:22:01.08,Main,,0,0,0,,However...Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.92,0:22:05.92,Main,,0,0,0,,He's different from the Donquixote Family, who appeared disguised as heroes,Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.92,0:22:08.42,Main,,0,0,0,,on that night a decade ago!Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.52,0:22:12.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy is the man that our true king,Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.72,0:22:17.22,Main,,0,0,0,,King Riku, called our "hope"!Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.20,0:22:26.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Right now, he's knocked out after being wounded in battle, but...Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.94,0:22:29.94,Main,,0,0,0,,It's not over yet!Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.79,0:22:35.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Tremble with joy, Dressrosa!Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.02,0:22:38.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Lucy...Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.08,0:22:42.63,Main,,0,0,0,,swore this to me!Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.60,0:22:49.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo will... Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.68,0:22:59.94,Main,,0,0,0,,...be KOed in a single blow!Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.74,0:23:12.07,Main,,0,0,0,,He's got a hell of a big mouth!Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.37,0:23:17.16,Main,,0,0,0,,You've gotta do it... We can't hold out much longer, Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.06,0:23:21.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Amazing!Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.75,0:23:21.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Lucy!Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.00,0:23:27.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you listening,Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.13,0:23:29.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.97,0:23:31.38,Main,,0,0,0,,You...Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.38,0:23:36.20,Main,,0,0,0,,used our king as a puppet, deceived the world,Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.20,0:23:40.47,Main,,0,0,0,,and lived here in Dressrosa as a false king!Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.00,0:23:43.69,Main,,0,0,0,,This will be your...Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.69,0:23:45.94,Main,,0,0,0,,execution stand!Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.00,0:23:52.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Gatz...Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.16,0:23:57.49,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I see everything you're up to, Doflamingo!Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.64,0:24:00.04,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,If you want me, come and get me!Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.04,0:24:04.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Stay away from Viola-sama and Rebecca-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.62,0:24:10.59,Main,,0,0,0,,It won't be long before the star forged in the Colosseum,Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.59,0:24:13.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Lucy, comes back!Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.60,0:24:19.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Until that moment comes, hang in there!Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.06,0:24:31.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy-senpai! Here we go!Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.08,0:24:44.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Hajrudin!Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.54,0:24:49.60,Main,,0,0,0,,What the...Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.60,0:24:53.60,Main,,0,0,0,,The injured who recovered earlier are collapsing again!Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.60,0:24:55.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Time's up.Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.38,0:25:00.88,Main,,0,0,0,,The effects of the Dandehealions on the initial recipients are wearing off.Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.28,0:25:03.27,Main,,0,0,0,,And it won't work twice in a row!Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.14,0:25:11.28,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I'm sorry! All because I don't have the strength...Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.28,0:25:13.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I lifted them up for a moment,Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.00,0:25:15.70,Main,,0,0,0,,only to drop them right back down! I'm awful!Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.70,0:25:18.16,Main,,0,0,0,,No, Princess Mansherry.Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.16,0:25:24.20,Main,,0,0,0,,If it weren't for the Dandehealions, who knows how many people would have died from the bird cage!Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.20,0:25:25.33,Main,,0,0,0,,But...Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.33,0:25:26.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Look!Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.33,0:25:30.63,Main,,0,0,0,,You've created a miracle!Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.00,0:25:33.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, please! What weaklings!Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.90,0:25:39.60,Main,,0,0,0,,People in the back take the places of the fallen! And bring more people!Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.60,0:25:41.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.06,0:25:47.00,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll hold out no matter what, until Lucy frees us from the bird cage!Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.00,0:25:49.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.77,0:25:51.87,Main,,0,0,0,,They've held out long enough.Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.87,0:25:55.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffyland will take over from there and rid us of the bird cage!Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.47,0:26:03.16,Main,,0,0,0,,And now the moment you've been waiting for... Lucy will come back in ten seconds!Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.70,0:26:11.04,Main,,0,0,0,,He should be somewhere, listening! Call out our star's name!Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.53,0:26:14.55,Secondary,,0,0,0,,Lucy! Lucy!Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.55,0:26:31.90,Secondary,,0,0,0,,Lucy! Lucy! Lucy!Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.69,0:26:24.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Three seconds to go!Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.00,0:26:32.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Two!Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.16,0:26:40.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Gatz-san!Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.20,0:26:42.95,Secondary,,0,0,0,,Lucy! Lucy!Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.95,0:26:44.91,Main,,0,0,0,,One!Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.91,0:26:46.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Ludicrous.Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.97,0:26:49.80,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Go to hell, Doflamingo!Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.80,0:26:53.04,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Our star Lucy's gonna...Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.04,0:26:54.92,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,drop you with a single blow!Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.56,0:27:04.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Zero!Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.09,0:27:20.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Viola, it's your turn to be silenced.Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.99,0:27:24.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Forever.Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.84,0:27:28.41,Main,,0,0,0,,No!Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.75,0:27:37.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Viola-san!Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.18,0:27:40.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Close your eyes, Rebecca!Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.30,0:27:43.14,Main,,0,0,0,,You don't have to see a thing! This is just a bad dream!Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.30,0:27:47.14,Main,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens, forget everything!Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.90,0:27:52.27,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't hold a grudge against you so...Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.27,0:27:53.48,Main,,0,0,0,,just forget about it, okay?Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.70,0:28:00.08,Main,,0,0,0,,No!Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.08,0:28:03.93,Main,,0,0,0,,It's not your fault at all!Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.93,0:28:05.90,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, Rebecca!Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.00,0:28:11.71,Main,,0,0,0,,This will leave a deep scar in your heart!Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.54,0:28:20.59,Main,,0,0,0,,No!Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.03,0:28:50.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Go!Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.33,0:28:58.67,Main,,0,0,0,,He has come!Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.67,0:29:01.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Lucy!Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.50,0:29:11.31,Secondary,,0,0,0,,Lucy! Lucy!Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.22,0:29:16.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat...Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.89,0:29:32.49,Main,,0,0,0,,A flashy comeback, I suppose.Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.49,0:29:37.58,Main,,0,0,0,,But you've barely managed to regain your Haki.Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.10,0:29:42.38,Main,,0,0,0,,You must barely be able to stand, no?Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.53,0:29:47.93,Main,,0,0,0,,That...Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.72,0:29:51.22,Main,,0,0,0,,goes for you too, right?!Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.12,0:29:59.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Lucy!Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.21,0:30:05.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Chambres!Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.27,0:30:12.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Rebecca!Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.06,0:30:24.56,Main,,0,0,0,,There you are.Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.53,0:30:29.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, watch closely, then...Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.36,0:30:33.85,Main,,0,0,0,,as your hope is crushed.Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.22,0:30:43.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Everwhite!Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.32,0:30:52.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Th-The entire town's turned to strings!Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.91,0:30:57.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Lucy!Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.61,0:30:59.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Why, you...Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.23,0:31:03.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Futile.Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.67,0:31:09.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Thousand Arrows!Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.42,0:31:11.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Flapping...Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.78,0:31:17.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Thread!Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.78,0:31:19.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Armament!Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.80,0:31:41.08,Main,,0,0,0,,What's the matter? I thought you were back at full strength?Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.68,0:31:50.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Have you really regained your Haki, Lucy?Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.10,0:31:56.10,Main,,0,0,0,,I-Is he gonna be okay?Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.67,0:32:25.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Lucy!Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.92,0:32:28.30,Main,,0,0,0,,That was pretty loud!Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.60,0:32:30.05,Main,,0,0,0,,It's too dusty to see clearly.Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.43,0:32:32.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Did Lucy win?Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.75,0:32:36.55,Main,,0,0,0,,The bird cage is still here!Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.55,0:32:38.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, Lucy!Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.34,0:32:45.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-What the...Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.16,0:32:49.27,Main,,0,0,0,,My body's moving on its own...Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.45,0:32:59.45,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you're still alive! Shall I impale you?Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.10,0:33:05.71,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Is that why you came running back?Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.25,0:33:09.09,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You made it out alive again, Luffy.Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.09,0:33:11.63,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Hmph! Next time I'll win!Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.03,0:33:15.30,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,What happened to that Kong Gun you're so proud of?Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.30,0:33:17.13,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Well, it's like this, Rayleigh!Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.13,0:33:20.30,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,This guy was way, way bigger than the other one...Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.30,0:33:21.63,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,So it didn't work!Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.90,0:33:25.73,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,That's quite the problem.Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.66,0:33:33.90,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,But if the Kong Gun isn't working, you have to come up with something else.Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.29,0:33:36.50,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Something else?Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.87,0:33:41.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Amusing, isn't it?Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.29,0:33:44.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Every single one of you...Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.40,0:33:50.04,Main,,0,0,0,,would have been better off staying in my cage and submitting to my manipulation.Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.92,0:33:52.92,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Cage?Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.19,0:33:55.59,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Manipulation?Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.18,0:33:59.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Humans are mere scum.Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.49,0:34:03.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Enough, already!Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.93,0:34:14.03,Main,,0,0,0,,The Royal Plateau is getting cut!Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.80,0:34:17.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.24,0:34:30.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Gonna do it again?Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.42,0:34:38.51,Main,,0,0,0,,If you turn into that Bound-Man of yours, I won't just have you kill your friends...Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.51,0:34:42.72,Main,,0,0,0,,but everyone in the country!Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.49,0:35:00.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Gear Fourth!Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.45,0:35:06.33,Main,,0,0,0,,The strings-!Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.30,0:35:19.50,Main,,0,0,0,,You've barely got any stamina left. How many seconds can you stay in that form?Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.40,0:35:25.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Lucy!Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.02,0:35:32.02,Main,,0,0,0,,He chose to fight me midair?Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.02,0:35:33.40,Main,,0,0,0,,He's got guts!Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.44,0:35:40.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Will I get to see how you're gonna "one-hit KO" me?!Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.83,0:36:02.34,Main,,0,0,0,,It's annoying to have you stand over me!Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.63,0:36:07.40,Main,,0,0,0,,You're always trying to chain down anything and everything...Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.91,0:36:16.77,Main,,0,0,0,,...and controlling and manipulating everybody!Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.71,0:36:31.12,Main,,0,0,0,,I feel like I'm suffocating!Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.12,0:36:32.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Blame your own birthright!Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.66,0:36:37.16,Main,,0,0,0,,All of you were born trash, fit only for manipulation!Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.76,0:36:40.88,Main,,0,0,0,,You humans are different from me!Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.90,0:36:43.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up!Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.88,0:36:47.60,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kick your ass and get outta here!Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.14,0:36:51.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Do your worst, brat!Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.00,0:36:53.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Spiderweb!Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.90,0:37:02.40,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,But if the Kong Gun isn't working, you have to come up with something else.Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.70,0:37:05.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.00,0:37:11.29,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Something else?Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.59,0:37:16.29,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,That's right. Gear Fourth taxes your body far too much.Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.29,0:37:19.00,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You've got to think of something else.Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.85,0:37:22.71,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,How about this, then?Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.54,0:37:30.31,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,What? That'll just make the problem even worse!Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.50,0:37:42.32,Main,,0,0,0,,King Kong...Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.45,0:37:53.60,Main,,0,0,0,,If you won't obey, I'll just kill you!Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.60,0:37:56.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Sixteen Holy Bullets!Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.04,0:38:04.67,Main,,0,0,0,,God Thread!Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.07,0:38:10.85,Main,,0,0,0,,...Gun!Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.80,0:38:41.29,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,And in a certain land, there are people who call the Family of "D"...Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.60,0:38:44.55,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,"the sworn enemy of the gods"!Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.01,0:39:09.40,OP11 Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Galaxy 9000 Sewil  Timing:  Datenshi, Sewil (Opening)  Quality Assurance:  Datenshi, Feeso, Galaxy 9000, Grug, Mr. Luffy  Soundtracking:  Halee  Graphics:  Datenshi  Translation: Yibis